\set ECHO none
--- cascading era removal removes both managed view types
drop era CASCADE | accepted
managed views remaining | 0
catalogued views remaining | 0
recreate era, key and both views | accepted
--- removal never silently cascades through a reused synchronization function
drop era RESTRICT | refused 2BP01
user trigger kept after drop era | true
era kept after refusal | true
drop synchronization trigger | refused 2BP01
user trigger kept after sync cleanup | true
DROP TABLE without CASCADE | refused 2BP01
base table kept after refusal | true
user trigger kept after DROP TABLE | true
era drops after user removes the dependency | accepted
--- dependency errors name the managed view and give the correct removal order
key removal names current view and its drop API | true
key removal names portion view and its drop API | true
table rename guidance drops views before keys | true
schema rename guidance drops views before keys | true
integrity after refused operations | accepted
